{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S06、S13等段的感受提示偏密，个别意象也有重复，容易分走听音乐的注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮的关键词让观众更快抓住每段的心理转折，感受提示又与音乐进程同步，不必一开始面对整堆短词。它对人物矛盾的交代更具体，尤其把怀念亲近、害怕孤单和不愿重新忍受委屈之间的拉扯讲清楚了；音乐感受也有更细的层次、动作和情绪变化，因此前后更容易形成一条完整的心理发展线。X的左右分栏确实更稳定、便于快速定位，但右侧感受词较多停留在概括性描述，音乐细节与人物心理之间的对应不如Y充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "91b5fbba-3b5b-4978-b40f-53133c04596d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T230759395674Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:09:07.745515+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "59c3759ac7a7c141126a2b3a56a731b43bb544d6a5d94e645e7b2a7b70f1b931", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at